      <title>Electric Vehicles Are Just the Tip of the UK’s Coming China Shock</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-06/electric-vehicles-are-just-the-tip-of-the-uk-s-coming-china-shock</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">9d92f4d113682b808b2906a2</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 05:00:23 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>The UK’s decision-making on China is characterized by “reactivity, inconsistency and opacity,” a parliamentary committee declared this week. That’s an assessment that’s been true for years, but is becoming more alarming as the world’s second-largest economy develops more technologically advanced, higher-value exports. Countries unprepared for epochal shifts lose control over how the changes shape them.</description>
