      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-06/-godzilla-minus-zero-makes-the-us-military-a-villain</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">783716096eceda1bfd26c1dd</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 05:00:20 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Nov. 3 was an important date for me. Yes, it was the US midterm elections, but it was also the 72nd birthday of Godzilla. I celebrated with tickets to an IMAX screening of Godzilla Minus Zero in Leicester Square here in London, a long way from the theater in downtown Manila where my father took me in 1965 to see Godzilla vs. The Thing  (aka Mothra vs. Godzilla), the first movie I saw starring the radioactive heavy-breather.</description>
